From: OfficeDroid contributors
Subject: [PATCH] crypt32: read Android's current Conscrypt trust store

Android 14 and later publish system certificate roots in the Conscrypt APEX.
Keep the legacy path for earlier devices, and preserve certificate verification.
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, like the modified Wine file.

--- a/dlls/crypt32/unixlib.c
+++ b/dlls/crypt32/unixlib.c
@@ -625,6 +625,7 @@
  "/usr/share/ca-certificates/ca-bundle.crt",
  "/usr/local/share/certs/",
  "/etc/sfw/openssl/certs",
+ "/apex/com.android.conscrypt/cacerts", /* Android 14 and later */
  "/etc/security/cacerts",  /* Android */
 };
 
